Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.74,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.47,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Brother, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.47,Serifa Std,,0,0,410,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.13,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What's this? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:37.77,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,That thing revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:41.27,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Damn, it hasn't been dead long enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:44.74,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs29}Brother, the stone! We have to find the stone after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:46.51,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,The stone? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:50.08,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs29}We need to find that big red stone fast and destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:53.68,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs24.8}If you have a plan, then hurry up! I can't hold out much longer!
